## How this guide is organized

- **Front matter** — acknowledgments, abbreviations, and an executive summary.
- **Part I. Introduction** — what EWARS in a box is and how to get started.
- **Part II. Setting up your EWARS account** — locations, indicators, forms, alarms, users and account settings.
- **Part III. Data Collection and Monitoring** — report manager, M&E auditor, alert log and data import.
- **Part IV. Data analysis, visualization and dissemination** — plots, mapping, widgets, dashboards, outbreaks, documents, websites, export, SMS reporting and EWARS Stand-alone.
